{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"pendingJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"processingJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"completedJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"failedJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cancelledJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"pausedJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup","text":"JobCleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .doNothing, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"logger"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Logging6LoggerV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Logger"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function is used to re-run or delete jobs in a certain state. Failed, completed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancelled and paused jobs can be pushed back into the pending queue to be re-run or removed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When called at startup in theory no job should be set to processing, or set to pending but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not in the queue. but if your job server crashes these states are possible, so we also provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"options to re-queue these jobs so they are run again."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cleanup"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"failedJobs"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completedJobs"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancelledJobs"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pausedJobs"},{"type":"text","text":" set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to whatever you like at any point to re-queue failed jobs. Moving processing or pending jobs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should only be done if you are certain there is nothing processing the job queue."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"pendingJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as pending","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"processingJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as processing"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"completedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as completed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"failedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as failed","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cancelledJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as cancelled"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"pausedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as paused","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"logger: Optional logger to use when performing cleanup","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"JobsPostgres","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cleanup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"pendingJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","text":"JobCleanup","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"processingJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","text":"JobCleanup","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completedJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","text"